# No Cursor commit attribution

- Never add `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, `Made with [Cursor](https://cursor.com)`, or any Cursor agent attribution trailer to git commits or PR bodies.
- Commit author must remain the user only (`nvnhan0810` / `nguyenvannhan0810@gmail.com`).
- If the environment tries to inject attribution, strip it before finishing the commit.
- For pull requests, never use bare `gh pr create`. Always use `scripts/gh-pr-create.sh` (creates the PR, then strips injected Cursor footers via `gh pr edit`).
- To fix an existing PR: `gh pr view N --json body -q .body | scripts/strip-cursor-attribution.sh | gh pr edit N --body-file -`
